d has contributed more than 13,900 articles to Bitcoin.com News since July 2015. His work has also appeared in Cointelegraph, Let's Talk Bitcoin, Bitcoinist, and Coingecko, and has been cited and featured in outlets including Motherboard Vice. He holds a Liberal Arts degree from Quincy College with an emphasis on writing and art. Connect with him on X and LinkedIn for more of his reporting and analysis. Disclosure: The author holds less than $500 in cryptocurrency assets.","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/jamie-redman-4688a7a9/","https://x.com/jamieCrypto","http://twitter.com/jamieCrypto","https://muckrack.com/jamie-redman"],"honorificPrefix":"Mr","birthDate":"1977-10-21","gender":"male","knowsAbout":["cryptocurrencies","technology","bitcoin"],"knowsLanguage":["English"],"jobTitle":"News Lead","worksFor":{"@id":"https://news.bitcoin.com/#organization"},"url":"https://news.bitcoin.com/author/jamie-redman/"}]}</script><div class="post-layout-grid mx-auto max-w-[1660px] px-m my-l"><main class="post-layout-main min-w-0"><article class="flex flex-col" data-post-slug="after-10-years-ross-ulbricht-speaks-out-bitcoin-doesnt-work-without-freedom"><div class="order-1 flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-1 md:order-2 md:mb-2 md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:gap-2.5"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="w-full min-w-0 md:order-2 md:w-auto md:flex-1"><ol class="m-0 flex min-w-0 list-none items-center p-0 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary"><li class="flex items-center shrink-0"><a class="truncate hover:text-shades-almost-black hover:underline" href="/">News</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-2 shrink-0">›</span></li><li class="flex items-center min-w-0"><a class="truncate hover:text-shades-almost-black hover:underline" href="/crypto-news/">Crypto News</a><span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-2 shrink-0">›</span></li><li class="min-w-0 truncate"><span aria-current="page" class="text-shades-almost-black">After 10 Years, Ross Ulbricht Speaks Out: ‘Bitcoin Doesn’t Work Without Freedom’</span></li></ol></nav><time dateTime="2025-05-30T14:30:27.000Z" class="hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-pill bg-[#00125C] text-xs leading-snug uppercase md:order-1"><span class="font-medium text-[#8FA0D0]">Published:</span><span class="font-medium text-[#CCD9FD]">May 30, 2025, 10:30 AM EDT</span></time></div><div class="order-2 mt-2 -mb-2 md:order-1 md:mt-0 md:mb-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:flex md:flex-wrap md:items-center"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.bitcoin.com/price/btc/"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 md:gap-[22px] lg:gap-2 bg-shades-extra-light rounded-[20px] px-1.5 py-1 lg:px-4 lg:py-2 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-px hover:shadow-lg"><img alt="Bitcoin" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-6 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" sizes="24px" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoin.png%3F1696501400&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoin.png%3F1696501400&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoin.png%3F1696501400&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoin.png%3F1696501400&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoin.png%3F1696501400&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoin.png%3F1696501400&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoin.png%3F1696501400&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcoin-images.coingecko.com%2Fcoins%2Fimages%2F1%2Flarge%2Fbitcoi